resources.string:
To ensure core functions run properly, Zorv AI uses the following system permissions on demand after your active authorization. We adhere to the principle of "minimum necessary, lawful, and transparent": 
· Permissions are requested and invoked only when you actively trigger the corresponding feature; 
· We do not silently collect, in the background, data unrelated to the current feature; 
· Any permission can be viewed and revoked at any time in system settings; revoking affects only that feature and will not crash the app. 
The following sections explain each permission’s purpose, when it is invoked, whether it is required, and the impact after revocation.

· We will not silently record, photograph, or screenshot in the background; 
· We will not upload your chat content to third parties unrelated to the app’s functions; 
· We will not request permissions unrelated to the functions; 
· The purpose and timing of all permission requests are disclosed in this statement.

You promise to use this App lawfully and must not engage in the following: 
· Violating national laws, regulations, or public order and good morals; 
· Infringing on others’ intellectual property, privacy, reputation, or other lawful rights; 
· Generating or disseminating illegal or harmful information for fraud, harassment, manipulation, or other harmful purposes; 
· Creating or spreading computer viruses or malicious code for cyberattacks; 
· Abusing deep-synthesis technology to forge others’ voices or likeness for fraud or infringement; 
· Circumventing or undermining the security measures of this App or third-party services; 
· Using this App to endanger national security, social stability, or public interest. 
You bear all consequences arising from improper use.

All behaviors and their consequences arising from your use of this App are your own legal responsibility, including but not limited to: 
· Legal disputes triggered by the content (Prompt) you input; 
· Decisions and actions you make based on AI-generated content; 
· Consequences of operating other apps through this App’s automation features; 
· Intellectual property, consumer-rights, and other issues involved in using AI-generated content for commercial purposes.

The following constitute illegal or non-compliant use; once discovered, this App has the right to take restrictive measures immediately and reserves the right to cooperate with law-enforcement agencies in investigations: 

1. Using this App to commit fraud, extortion, defamation, or infringements on citizens’ personal information; 
2. Using deep-synthesis features to forge others’ identities, create false evidence, or commit identity impersonation; 
3. Using automation features to illegally obtain, tamper with, or delete others’ data; 
4. Using this App to bypass network security measures, intrude into others’ systems, or steal trade secrets; 
5. Using AI to generate large amounts of false information for dissemination, marketing fraud, or public-opinion manipulation; 
6. Violating the Cybersecurity Law, Data Security Law, Personal Information Protection Law, Interim Measures for the Management of Generative AI Services, and other laws and regulations. 

For the above behaviors, this App will take the following measures as appropriate: 
· Restrict or terminate your access to part or all of the functions; 
· Retain relevant logs and evidence and cooperate with public security organs and network security authorities in investigations; 
· Pursue your civil compensation liability according to law; 
· If a crime is suspected, report it to judicial authorities according to law.

